# ── Internal / sensitive — NOT for the public portfolio repo ─────────────────
# Reasons: live secrets, credential IDs, internal pricing, and working notes.
#
# docs/decisions.md      will hold live webhook tokens + n8n credential IDs
# docs/testing-log.md    internal QA notes + instance references
# docs/OWNERS-GUIDE.md   internal rate card, client pitch, and build status
# docs/arabic-style-guide-internal.md
#                        full Arabic QA log: build-time narratives, testing-log
#                        citations, and the open items awaiting the owner's ruling.
#                        prompts/arabic-style-guide.md is the public edition of it.
# CLAUDE.md              internal working standards + personal tooling references
# PLAN.md                internal build playbook (credential IDs, deferred notes)
# case-study-2-spec.md   contains rate-card / pricing (business-sensitive, §9)
# docs/system-overview.md
#                        plain-language architecture reference (2026-09-01). Names the live store
#                        handle and cross-references the ignored internal docs, so it is internal
#                        until someone decides otherwise. README.md + docs/case-study.md are the
#                        public-facing explanations.
#
# If you want the rigor showcases public, ask for REDACTED copies of
# decisions.md / testing-log.md instead of un-ignoring these.
docs/decisions.md
docs/testing-log.md
docs/OWNERS-GUIDE.md
docs/arabic-style-guide-internal.md
CLAUDE.md
PLAN.md
case-study-2-spec.md
docs/system-overview.md

# ── Secrets (belt-and-suspenders) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Shopify Admin API tokens (shpat_*) and webhook signing secrets live ONLY in
# the n8n credential store — never in a tracked file, never in a workflow JSON,
# never in a URL. Same rule as the Twilio/Anthropic keys in Case 1.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*secret*
*credentials*
*.myshopify.com*
shpat_*

